1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:05,540
Kabhi notice kiya hai apne ghar me... ki baalti aur mug neele ya laal hi kyun hai?

2
00:00:05,540 --> 00:00:07,890
Zyadatar gharo me yahi color milega.

3
00:00:07,890 --> 00:00:11,200
Main batata hu... asli wajah plastic me chhupi hai.

4
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:15,710
Plastic asal mein dudhiya safed hota hai — rang alag se milaya jaata hai.

5
00:00:15,710 --> 00:00:20,370
Aur aapki baalti... ho sakta hai pehle kisi ka toota dabba thi!

6
00:00:20,370 --> 00:00:25,450
Sasti baaltiyan recycled plastic se banti hain, jo mix hoke matmaila ho jaata hai.

7
00:00:25,450 --> 00:00:29,440
Is matmaile plastic se safed ya halka rang ban hi nahi sakta.

8
00:00:29,440 --> 00:00:33,510
Gehra neela aur laal us gandagi ko aaraam se chhupa lete hain.

9
00:00:33,510 --> 00:00:38,990
Aur agar khaara paani use hua hai to uske daag aur peelapan bhi neele-laal pe dikhte nahi.

10
00:00:38,990 --> 00:00:41,610
Aapke ghar mein baalti aur mug ka color kya hai?

11
00:00:41,610 --> 00:00:45,640
Comment karo, aur subscribe karo Whysplained!
